  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Peru partner learning exchange and training on new PFA requirements</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project aims for all Peru partners to meet and, in the light of the Andes Team&apos;s revised regional strategy and in the context of Laudato Si&apos;, to understand where synergies exist and opportunities for working together. It also aims to provide partners with a face to face opportunity to understand and discuss the requirements of the new PFA and its implications for their work and the communities they serve. Finally, it will facilitate a meeting of all partners with the new UK ambassador to Peru, to present and discuss the main advocacy issues partners are facing and wish to raise with her.</narrative>
  </description>
